@xiaoso/dsh-run-config README · 使用示例：在会话里直接说：

> 把 `git pull && pnpm install` 保存为任务配置，以后一键运行

大模型会调用 `task_run_config` 工具创建命令任务配置（写操作会弹出审批确认，除非会话处于完全权限模式），创建后即可在会话头部选择并一键运行。

@xiaoso/dsh-run-config README · 本地开发：```sh
dsh plugin --profile web add link:<本仓库路径>
```

@xiaoso/dsh-run-config README · 环境要求：- **Node.js** ≥ 22（`package.json` 的 `engines` 要求）
- **Git Bash**（推荐）：Windows 上推荐使用 Git Bash 作为 shell 环境
- 适用于 DeepSeek Harness `dsh` **0.2.1 线**（`>=0.2.1-0 <0.3.0-0`，写在 `package.json` 顶层 `engines.dsh`；dsh 的插件版本闸门**优先读该字段**并按 `includePrerelease` 语义求值，范围不符时本插件条目会被禁用；`peerDependencies` 里的同一范围只供 npm 解析）。dsh **0.2.0-rc.2** 线请装 `@xiaoso/dsh-run-config@0.2.3`，0.2.0-rc.1 线装 `0.2.1`，0.1.7 线装 `0.2.0`，0.1.5 线装 `0.1.5`

@xiaoso/dsh-run-config README · Local development：```sh
dsh plugin --profile web add link:<path-to-this-repo>
```

@xiaoso/dsh-run-config README · From GitHub：```sh
dsh plugin --profile web add github:xiaoso456/dsh-run-config
```

Git installs run this package's `prepare` script to build the artifacts;
with pnpm ≥10 the first `add` may fail and ask you to allow the build in the
profile's `pnpm-workspace.yaml`.

@xiaoso/dsh-run-config README · Requirements：- **Node.js** ≥ 22 (per the `engines` field in `package.json`)
- **Git Bash** (recommended): recommended shell environment on Windows
- Built for the DeepSeek Harness `dsh` **0.2.1 line** (`>=0.2.1-0 <0.3.0-0`, declared in the top-level `engines.dsh` of `package.json`; dsh's plugin version gate **reads that field first** and evaluates it with `includePrerelease` semantics, so this plugin's row is disabled when the range does not match; the same range under `peerDependencies` is for npm resolution only). On the dsh **0.2.0-rc.2** line install `@xiaoso/dsh-run-config@0.2.3`, on 0.2.0-rc.1 install `0.2.1`, on the 0.1.7 line install `0.2.0`, on the 0.1.5 line install `0.1.5`
